{"model":"gpt-6-luna","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"## Task\n\nExtract lead information from the text. Look for names, emails, phone numbers, company names, job titles, and addresses.\n\n## Tool Use\n\nUse the provided tool `extracted_data` to extract correct and accurate structured data from the input.\n\nTool purpose: Function call based on user instructions.\n\nCall the tool with the best supported arguments for the requested extraction."},{"role":"user","content":"Hey, I just got off the phone with a potential client. Here are the details:\n\nHis name is John Smith and he works as VP of Engineering at TechCorp Industries.\nThey're based in San Francisco, California, USA. You can reach him at\njohn.smith@techcorp.io or call him at +1-555-0123.\n\nHe's interested in our enterprise plan and wants a demo next week."}],"max_completion_tokens":1024,"tools":[{"type":"function","function":{"name":"extracted_data","description":"Function call based on user instructions.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"hasValue":{"type":"boolean","description":"True if value extracted, false if data not available"},"value":{"type":["object","null"],"properties":{"name":{"type":"string","default":""},"email":{"type":"string","default":""},"company":{"type":"string","nullable":true,"default":null},"phone":{"type":"string","nullable":true,"default":null},"role":{"type":"string","nullable":true,"default":null},"address":{"type":"string","nullable":true,"default":null},"city":{"type":"string","nullable":true,"default":null},"country":{"type":"string","nullable":true,"default":null}},"additionalProperties":false,"description":"Correctly extracted values of Lead"},"error":{"type":"string","description":"Obligatory if no value extracted - provide reason"}},"required":["hasValue"]}}}],"tool_choice":{"type":"function","function":{"name":"extracted_data"}},"reasoning_effort":"none"}